ADDITIONAL NOTICE FOR THIS PROJECT

This Software is sample and demonstration code, provided as a reference for
building on AR smart glasses. It is not a finished consumer product.

AWARENESS. It drives a display worn over the eyes. Reading while moving
obscures and distracts from hazards. Do not use it while driving, cycling or
operating machinery, and stay alert to traffic, terrain, obstacles and other
people. Use is entirely at your own risk.

THIRD-PARTY SERVICES. Optional features send text to services outside your
control: passages are transmitted to fish.audio to be narrated, and to Google
Gemini if the reading coach is enabled. Those features require your own API
keys and are off until you supply them, but when enabled the content of what
you are reading leaves your device and is handled under those providers'
terms, not these. Nothing is bundled, and no key is needed to read a book.

CONTENT. This Software reads files you supply. Obtaining and using those
files lawfully — copyright included — is your responsibility.
